the Fuse_epilogue precondition refusal is raised typed, as Illegal_schedule at Transform: true
strict=true: the refusal reads as a classified decline carrying the refusal: true
strict=false: the refusal reads as a classified decline carrying the refusal: true
the public Schedule.apply renders the same refusal as Invalid_argument: true
the benign schedule applies without the injection: true
an injected Invalid_argument escapes apply_classified untyped: true
strict: an untyped transform exception is fatal, its own exception and no cause: true
permissive: the same exception is contained as Unclassified, never as Illegal_schedule: true
the public Schedule.apply still raises the injected Invalid_argument itself: true
the fault seam is scoped: it is gone once with_transform_fault returns: true
